&lt;p&gt;The Seattle city government provides a public API for fire department emergency dispatch data. There’s a very cool project, &lt;a href="https://sfdlive.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;SFD Live&lt;/a&gt;, that visualizes this information (and a lot more) with a ton of features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What I wanted, though, was something much simpler: a stripped-down view of the data that would be interesting, if not especially useful, on a dashboard I could glance at from across the room. I had an old monitor and a spare Raspberry Pi lying around, so slapping those together and running a web app in kiosk mode on the Pi felt like the perfect excuse for a small side project.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>